guide forever/reputation/undercity
title Undercity Reputation
category Reputation
faction Horde
levels 12-60
zone Undercity
# Built from the Era-baseline reference data: Ralston Farnsley, the Undercity
# cloth quartermaster, and the cloth quests 7813/7814/7817/7818 (one-time) and 7819
# (Additional Runecloth, repeatable) from quests.json; cloth farm spots are
# the densest spawn clusters of strong cloth droppers in items.json/npcs.json.
# Nothing public shows Forever changing the cloth donations; this has NOT been
# play-tested on Forever yet. Refine it with Polestar_Recorder sessions.
#
# The client never flags a repeatable quest as completed, so the Additional
# Runecloth steps finish on the Undercity standing (rep 68); each
# step's optional `turnin 7819 direct` checks off at its first hand-in. Cloth counts (60 per first donation, 20 per repeat) are game
# knowledge: the data only has the 60 Runecloth of A Donation of Runecloth.

step Ralston Farnsley: A Donation of Wool
  tip Ralston Farnsley takes cloth for Undercity in Undercity. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, Additional Runecloth repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains.
  level 12
  accept 7813

step Wool Cloth
  zone The Barrens
  tip Venture Co. Enforcers at the Boulder Lode Mine (level 16-17) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 2592 x60 quest 7813.1 @61,4.2

step Ralston Farnsley: A Donation of Silk
  zone Undercity
  turnin 7813
  level 26
  accept 7814

step Silk Cloth
  zone Desolace
  tip Kolkar centaur (level 30-33) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 4306 x60 quest 7814.1 @72.4,47.1

step Ralston Farnsley: A Donation of Mageweave
  zone Undercity
  turnin 7814
  level 40
  accept 7817

step Mageweave Cloth
  zone Tanaris
  tip Dunemaul ogres (level 45-48) drop it here. The Auction House works too.
  collect 4338 x60 quest 7817.1 @40.1,54.4

step Ralston Farnsley: A Donation of Runecloth
  zone Undercity
  turnin 7817
  level 50
  accept 7818

step Runecloth
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) drop it here; every Scourge kill here also counts toward the Argent Dawn (see that guide). The Auction House works too.
  collect 14047 x60 quest 7818.1 @40,51.3

step Ralston Farnsley: Runecloth delivered
  zone Undercity
  turnin 7818

step Additional Runecloth to Honored
  tip Additional Runecloth takes 20 Runecloth per turn-in and repeats as often as you like. Bring Runecloth in multiples of 20 and hand them all in at once, one turn-in after another. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7819 direct optional
  rep 68 Honored

step Additional Runecloth to Revered
  tip Keep handing in Additional Runecloth, 20 Runecloth at a time. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7819 direct optional
  rep 68 Revered

step Additional Runecloth to Exalted
  tip Keep handing in Additional Runecloth until Undercity is Exalted. Runecloth: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in Eastern Plaguelands, or the Auction House.
  collect 14047 x20 optional @40,51.3 map 1423
  turnin 7819 direct optional
  rep 68 Exalted
